OL,3,GNEWSAMother hen chooses brewery as new
OL,4,Ahome
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrewery staff have made a home for a
OL,7,Fhen and her chicks after the new family
OL,8,Fchose the distillery as a place to
OL,9,Fsettle.
OL,11,FThe hen, who staff have called
OL,12,FJosephine, arrived at Alnwick Brewery,
OL,13,Fin Northumberland, in May this year and
OL,14,Fstaff immediately took a liking to her.
OL,16,FStaff consulted local farmers for
OL,17,Fadvice on how to look after the hen,
OL,18,Fwith one employee even driving to
OL,19,FScotland to pick up a wooden house for
OL,20,Fher.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
